  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups crumbled cornbread",
    "5 biscuits, crumbled",
    "6 cups chicken broth, divided",
    "0.5 cup margarine",
    "0.5 cup diced celery",
    "1 small onion, finely chopped",
    "3 large eggs, beaten",
    "1 teaspoon sage",
    "1 teaspoon black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n3-4PVodRi8bKSNW2cE3jBkQYJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-31-step1-c19a39380eba498bbde78c97f46ce6a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine crumbled cornbread and biscuits in a large bowl. Bring broth to a boil in a large saucepan. Pour 1/2 of the boiling broth over cornbread mixture; cover and let stand.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W7SpdbsMgF0Lr1rvbc6leGQugCI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-35-step5-442697f2a23b45c1a154687c3873c86e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt margarine in a medium skillet over medium heat. Add onion and celery; sauté until tender, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xe09R_O--5Jhgw2DVnXEiVucM78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-37-step7-a5ad62c555954cb5a92e9a5670618be6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat and stir into cornbread mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B-87lIBccQMgzvHHM7p8ORcwk6s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-38-step8-b0dc92f4cf294e5b98fbdaad13a79373.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour remaining broth over cornbread mixture. Stir in eggs, sage, and pepper until well combined; transfer to the prepared roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tfvnGdYt4Uxx3hn9b60UI9_5wvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-41-step11-d9393e065e6a434884502e13ebd0e755.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until set in the middle and golden brown on top, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a6peQX1KL6_UhKVmk_tI9yvEzyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24318-Chicken-Dressing-DDMFS-42-step12-c7bcf210027841449ca806f3da296c2a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24318/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
